      "index": "b2g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 601831982,
      "version": 352,
      "versionNonce": 1397158572,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785905689571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nData flow\n\n1. Take seed URL from frontier \n2. Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n3. Extract text data from HTML\n4. Store text data in database\n5 Extract any linked URLs from webpages and add them \nlist of URLS to crawl\n6. Repeat step 1-5 until url has been crawled",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nData flow\n\n1. Take seed URL from frontier \n2. Fetch HTML from external server using IP\n3. Extract text data from HTML\n4. Store text data in database\n5 Extract any linked URLs from webpages and add them \nlist of URLS to crawl\n6. Repeat step 1-5 until url has been crawled",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
